B.eHf=new A.y("spacing",B.aG,"column-section-gap-0812: the default vertical gap (logical px) inserted between every pair of adjacent children \u2014 the tight, inside-a-group value. Omit for the prior zero-gap behavior.",B.j,null,!1)
