B.CQ=new A.y("scopeRowId",B.T,"Restrict this tile to the CONTAINS-subtree rooted at this row: a literal row id or a `$`-token (`$rowId`, `$selected:<table>`). The ROOT ROW ITSELF IS INCLUDED (same contract as `cards.scopeRowId`). Unset (absent) = unchanged, whole-table behavior. Configured but UNRESOLVED (e.g. `$selected:` with nothing selected) fails CLOSED to the empty set \u2014 never silently falls back to the whole board.",B.j,null,!1)
