B.eGd=new A.y("height",B.T,'Optional height. Unset with an UNBOUNDED slot (desktop / page scroll) keeps the historic intrinsic content height. Given a BOUNDED slot (phone) \u2014 or an explicit value \u2014 the timeline fills that height and pans INTERNALLY on both axes (a long plan gets a legible per-day width and scrolls sideways instead of squeezing). Accepts a number (logical px), "fill" (the full available body height, scrolling/panning internally), or "<frac>fill" (e.g. "0.55fill").',B.j,null,!1)
