B.eZD=new A.y("archiveEnabled",B.a8,'dufb17a-0924: opt-in ARCHIVE lifecycle (edges-mode only). A layer orthogonal to status: the row menu gains Archive/Unarchive, which flips the row\'s incoming contains edge(s) to type "archived" and back (retire-never-delete; the row itself is never rewritten or deleted, no other edge is touched; a top-level row gets a single empty-parent archived marker edge). Archived rows leave the tree/cards/Starred/search views and every rollup; archiving a folder hides its whole subtree and unarchiving restores it as it was. An "Archived (N)" disclosure at the foot of the rail lists them dimmed with Unarchive. Off (default) = unchanged.',B.j,null,!1)
