B.en2=new A.dm("composer",'A chat-style "type a message and send" input. Unlike notepad (which edits one row in place), it APPENDS a new row each send \u2014 carrying the typed text plus preset values ($playerId/now/uuid resolved) \u2014 then clears itself. The primitive for chats, comments and logs.',B.c_S,!1)
