B.eVw=new A.y("hideTitle",B.a8,'Editable record only: hide the "Edit <table>" heading (action icons stay) when the record already sits under its own title, e.g. in a popup headed by the row\'s name.',B.j,null,!1)
B.eOJ=new A.y("backOnClose",B.a8,"Editable record only (form-input-1101): when the editor closes (Save \u2713, Discard, Delete) step back to the screen that opened this one \u2014 pop the nearest route, else hand `back` to the host. Makes a form screen's Save return to its list. Default off (stays in place).",B.j,null,!1)
