B.eFu=new A.y("editedByColumn",B.H,'Opt-in: ref column stamped with the actor when a save actually changes a field (not on create, not on a no-op save) \u2014 an honest "last edited by".',B.j,null,!1)
B.eZq=new A.y("editedAtColumn",B.H,"Opt-in: date column stamped today alongside editedByColumn on a real edit.",B.j,null,!1)
B.eGP=new A.y("valueLabels",B.a7,'Opt-in (overviewsweep-0822), display-only: raw stored value \u2192 display text map (flat `{value: entry}` or column-keyed `{column: {value: entry}}`), each entry a plain string or a {lang: text} map. Used by the "chips" layout\'s inline "Label \xb7 value" chips so an enum/status column shows a translated word instead of the raw stored value under a non-English locale; the stored value itself is never touched. Same shape/precedence as the "cards" node\'s valueLabels.',B.j,null,!1)
B.eH8=new A.y("chipsInset",B.aG,'dispfb-1018, "chips" layout: horizontal inset (px) around the heading/chips block. Default 20 (unchanged). Set 0 when a parent (e.g. an explorer `detailGutter`) already supplies the gutter.',B.j,null,!1)
B.f00=new A.y("placeholders",B.a7,'Opt-in (dufb-1017), "chips" layout: `{column: text}` \u2014 a listed field that is EMPTY shows a muted placeholder (e.g. "Untitled", "No comment yet") instead of disappearing, so an untitled row never borrows its next field as the heading. Each text is a {lang: text} map or a plain engine string key (recordPlaceholderUntitled, recordPlaceholderNoComment).',B.j,null,!1)
