B.eny=new A.dm("newsdesk","The newstime applet surface (newstime2-1012): a coverage-ranked news feed over our news server's static v2 files (numbered rows with coverage bars, a right rail on desktop, a lead block on phone), the Filters / Outlet-languages / Add-source popups, a Sources screen and a News map (the engine map node, countries shaded by story count). No AI \u2014 stories arrive pre-clustered; this node filters, merges and ranks by counting outlets.",B.cL5,!1)
